    "description": "Dr Yasmin Amarsi, Founding Dean, Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery, East Africa, has been awarded an honorary Doctor of Science degree by McMaster University, Canada. This prestigious award is bestowed on individuals who have made noteworthy impact in public service or other areas at national or international levels.",
